sequenceDiagram
    participant Game as Game (localforage)
    participant Sync as wai-save-sync.js
    participant API as FastAPI /api/gamesave
    Note over Sync: page load
    Sync->>API: POST each local slot (save1..3), not awaited
    Sync->>API: GET /api/gamesave
    API-->>Sync: slots present on server
    Sync->>Game: overwrite IndexedDB for each slot the server has, server wins
    Sync->>Game: then load bundle scripts
    Note over Game: play, saves write to IndexedDB
    Game-->>Sync: IDBObjectStore.put intercepted
    Sync->>API: POST /api/gamesave/slot  body save
